tio":0.43235},{"ratio":0.97,"watchRatio":0.4235},{"ratio":0.98,"watchRatio":0.41125},{"ratio":0.99,"watchRatio":0.39725},{"ratio":1,"watchRatio":0.3913}],"script":{"source_path":"2026-09-william-jones-asiatic-society.md","words":185,"wpm":null,"lang":"en","chapters":[],"blocks":[{"sec":0,"text":"This guy's started a club to study"},{"sec":1.8,"text":"Indian history and banned Indians from"},{"sec":3.8,"text":"joining it. And that's not even the"},{"sec":5.3,"text":"strange part. When William Jones started"},{"sec":7.4,"text":"Asiatic Society to study Hindu"},{"sec":9.3,"text":"scriptures, laws, and history, he"},{"sec":11.2,"text":"employed an army of Brahmins to do the"},{"sec":13.5,"text":"actual translation. They could work for"},{"sec":15.4,"text":"the society, but they couldn't join it."},{"sec":17.2,"text":"Now, here's where it gets really"},{"sec":18.5,"text":"strange. Jones, a devout Anglican"},{"sec":20.7,"text":"Christian, believed in biblical"},{"sec":22.3,"text":"timelines. The world was created in 4004"},{"sec":24.8,"text":"BC, and nothing could have survived"},{"sec":26.6,"text":"Noah's flood. But there was a problem."},{"sec":28.5,"text":"Hindu scriptures talk about ages running"},{"sec":30.6,"text":"into millions of years. So, Jones called"},{"sec":32.8,"text":"that allegory and squeezed every Indian"},{"sec":34.8,"text":"king, every scripture into the years"},{"sec":36.8,"text":"after the flood. Anything that didn't"},{"sec":38.6,"text":"fit biblical worldview became a myth."},{"sec":40.9,"text":"And that's the timeline Indology started"},{"sec":43.1,"text":"from. And it gets worse. In 1875, an"},{"sec":45.7,"text":"Indian scholar named Rajendralal Mitra"},{"sec":47.9,"text":"published the first survey of Orissa's"},{"sec":49.8,"text":"temple. Britain's leading architectural"},{"sec":51.9,"text":"historian argued that as an Indian race,"},{"sec":54.5,"text":"Mitra wasn't capable of scholarly work."},{"sec":56.5,"text":"That mindset never left Western"},{"sec":58,"text":"academia. It still decides who gets to"},{"sec":60,"text":"explain Hinduism."}],"text":""}}